{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础理论","docCount":3,"url":"/h/data-science/time-series-forecasting/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"time-series-decomposition","title":"时间序列分解与平稳性分析","url":"/h/data-science/time-series-forecasting/foundations/time-series-decomposition","wordCount":1208,"readingTime":5},{"seq":2,"slug":"statistical-models","title":"经典统计预测模型","url":"/h/data-science/time-series-forecasting/foundations/statistical-models","wordCount":1250,"readingTime":5},{"seq":3,"slug":"evaluation-metrics","title":"预测评估指标体系","url":"/h/data-science/time-series-forecasting/foundations/evaluation-metrics","wordCount":1335,"readingTime":6}],"introMarkdown":"# 基础理论\n\n本章建立时间序列预测的核心概念框架。从分解与平稳性入手，理解为什么「去趋势 + 去季节性」是几乎所有方法的预处理前提；然后深入经典统计模型（ARIMA、指数平滑），它们至今仍是强基线；最后系统梳理预测评估指标，为后续章节的模型比较提供统一标尺。\n\n学完本章后，你将具备判断一条时序数据「该用什么方法族」的初步直觉，也能正确评估任何模型输出的质量。\n"}